                <pb facs="0969" n="951" xml:id="pg951"/>

                <head>Annex E</head>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Statement by the Delegations of the United States,
                        United Kingdom, France, and the Soviet Union</hi>
                </p>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Requests by Other Interested Governments To Express
                        Their Views to the Council of Foreign Ministers</hi>
                </p>
                <p>In presenting their views on the disposal of the former Italian Colonies the
                    Governments of Australia and of the Union of South Africa made a definite
                    request for an opportunity to present views to the Council of Foreign
                    Ministers.</p>
                <p>In addition, the following other interested Governments have informed the
                    Deputies that they reserve the right to present views direct to the Ministers:
                        <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>Byelorussian S.S.R., New Zealand, Poland, Ukrainian S.S.R. and
                            Yugoslavia.</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <p>The Deputies inform the Ministers of these facts so as to enable them to consider
                    the question at the appropriate time.</p>
            </div>
